        #   … resolver none|from-frame-effect|-native ID|{words ctx} {…}
        #   widen … covers … commit … }`, but a draft records only that
        #   the field is set, never the expression that set it.

        option -force -detail {Overwrite an existing destination file.}
        option -- \
            -detail {Marks the end of switches; the following word is treated as source even if it starts with -.}
